# .what = tells git to ignore this dir
# .why = holds ephemeral, local-only runtime state, never source
#   - enrolled-actor records + caches are host-local
#   - regenerated on demand; none of it belongs in git history
# .note = safe to delete; rhachet recreates it as needed
# .note = the repo actor's brain dir is the one exception: it holds the ambient roles' brain config
/*
!/.gitignore
!/actor.via.repo=ambient/
/actor.via.repo=ambient/*
!/actor.via.repo=ambient/brain/
/actor.via.repo=ambient/brain/*
!/actor.via.repo=ambient/brain/.claude/
